# What floor's core is. Every gate that refuses a word in core reads this file and no other.
#
# Core is what floor ships and runs. Not `tests`, which stands a host up on purpose, and not the
# other plugins, which have no such boundary to keep.
#
# Each gate held its own copy of this list, word for word, and nothing made the copies agree. A
# directory added to one left the other gates green over code they had never read.
#
# A `#` line is prose. Every other line is one directory, from the repository root.

plugins/floor/bin
plugins/floor/lib
plugins/floor/hooks
